summary:
  Any whole number from 0 up passes for a time.

history:
  Before there were several readings an entry began with its one reading.
  Such an entry whose reading is a small whole number would be taken for a
  time and a reading of 0 LUFS, and its station turned down by fifteen
  decibels.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
      return Number.isFinite(n) && (n === 0 || n >= EPOCH_S) && Math.floor(n) === n;

replace:
      return Number.isFinite(n) && n >= 0 && Math.floor(n) === n;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_an_entry_that_is_not_one_is_not_read.
  Line-neutral.
